  "description": "Language resource adapter for MASA.Lingua on Blazor (Server/Wasm) + Masa.Blazor apps. Two modes auto-selected: when a shared Lingua store is registered (e.g. alongside AddLinguaMasaI18n in a Blazor Server host) it merges terms from the hot-reloading store and follows culture-update notifications — UI and backend terms share one SSE/polling sync chain; otherwise a startup pull fetches published {culture}.json bundles before first render. Static wwwroot/i18n JSON always remains as the offline fallback.",
